{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Radio Tower in the remote, isolate</strong>d co<strong>untryside is your next assignment. What appears to be a quick repair job quickly spirals into a dreadful ordeal. No one has seen the previous Technician and the Corporation has sent you alone to fix this mess.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Assignment from your Superiors</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix computer terminals, generators, ventilation systems and transformers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of specialised tools, engineering equipment, scanners, radios and your technical prowess to restore the facility functionality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're entirely alone - your assignment will only finish once the radio tower is operational. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the Corporation's true purpose for the facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Search for the previous Technician's whereabouts and uncover their fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the origin of the anomalous activity and learn its true nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever lurks in the darkness - watching and stalking you - threatens to  sabotage your mission. It will not hesitate to seek you out... and annihilate you at any moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, intense, linear horror experience (30 minutes to 1 hour), depending on your thoroughness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meticulously hand-crafted environment decorated with secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face up against an adversary that evolves and shifts its behaviour based on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomised and unpredictable events will mean no two playthroughs will ever be the same.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728910?t=1761966145","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728910?t=1761966145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728910/899091568b8bfc818bbb0dc7d4b5b4e7a0c6c62b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761966145","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728910/899091568b8bfc818bbb0dc7d4b5b4e7a0c6c62b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761966145","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Depictions of violence, gore and mutilation. Strong themes of psychosis and paranoia. "},"demos":[{"appid":3922230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Radio Tower in the remote, isolate</strong>d co<strong>untryside is your next assignment. What appears to be a quick repair job quickly spirals into a dreadful ordeal. No one has seen the previous Technician and the Corporation has sent you alone to fix this mess.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Assignment from your Superiors</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix computer terminals, generators, ventilation systems and transformers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of specialised tools, engineering equipment, scanners, radios and your technical prowess to restore the facility functionality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're entirely alone - your assignment will only finish once the radio towe